WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.767
Okay!

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:03.967
Which one does NOT belong?

00:00:03.967 --> 00:00:04.600
A.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.267
Rose,

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:05.900
B.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.533
Train,

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:07.167
C.

00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:07.800
Car,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.100
or D.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:09.733
Plane?

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:11.000
Five seconds!

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.467
TIME'S UP!

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.200
The answer is...

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:19.633
A,

00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:20.067
rose!

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:20.967
A car,

00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:21.400
train,

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.133
and plane carry people.

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.333
A rose is a flower,

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:27.500
so it does not belong.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:28.433
So...

00:00:28.433 --> 00:00:30.333
are you a smart fella,

00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:31.867
or a fart smella?
